      "side": 1,
      "message": "The logic should be checked by the following order if you don\u0027t plan to have separate toggles for unicast/broadcast and further change in the developer setting.\n1. if LE_AUDIO_DYNAMIC_SWITCH_PROPERTY supported, the le audio switcher toggle is enabled\n2. if LE_AUDIO_DYNAMIC_ENABLED_PROPERTY enabled, the unicast could be enabled\n3. if LE_AUDIO_BROADCAST_DYNAMIC_SWITCH_PROPERTY supported, and LE_AUDIO_DYNAMIC_ENABLED_PROPERTY enabled, the broadcast could be enabled.\n\nSo I would suggest to check LE_AUDIO_BROADCAST_DYNAMIC_SWITCH_PROPERTY inside setLeAudioProfileStatus function in line#227",
